              "printed_page": 141,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "defects in dogs,<10% of congenital heart"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "septum, adjacent to the atrioventricular [AV]",
              "pdf_page": 223,
              "printed_page": 141,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "defects in dogs,<10% of congenital heart"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "valves), ostium secundum ASD (central portion",
              "pdf_page": 223,
              "printed_page": 141,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "defects in dogs,<10% of congenital heart"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "of the septum, region of fossa ovalis), and sinus",
              "pdf_page": 223,
              "printed_page": 141,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "defects in dogs,<10% of congenital heart"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "venosus ASD (adjacent to cranial or caudal vena",
              "pdf_page": 223,
              "printed_page": 141,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "defects in dogs,<10% of congenital heart"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "cava).",
